    <bpmn:process id="W_W772" name="W772. Store-Level Rain Check Issuance for Out-of-Stock Promotional Items" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer requests promotional item that is out of stock during promotional period
Frequency: During promotional periods; ~5–10 rain check requests per store per promotional event
Volume: 200 stores × ~7 rain checks per promo event × 6 major promos/year = ~8,400 rain checks/year
Owner: Customer Service Rep
Participants: CSR, Department Supervisor, Customer
Source: workflow W772 — Store-Level Rain Check Issuance for Out-of-Stock Promotional Items</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W772_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W772_Lane1" name="CSR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W772_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W772_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W772_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W772_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W772_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W772_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W772_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W772_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W772_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W772_Lane3" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W772_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W772_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W772_Start5" name="Customer requests promotional item that is out of stock during promotional period">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W772_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W772_Task6" name="Customer request received">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer request received: Customer approaches customer service counter requesting out-of-stock promotional item; CSR verifies: (a) item is currently in advertised promotion per W13 promotional calendar, (b) item is out of stock at this store per POS inventory check
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W772_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W772_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W772_Task7" name="Inventory check and alternative offer">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Inventory check and alternative offer: CSR checks: (a) current store inventory (confirmed OOS), (b) nearby store availability for customer pickup, (c) expected replenishment date from W596 replenishment exception management; offers alternatives: (i) rain check at this store, (ii) transfer from nearby store per W214, (iii) substitute product per W279
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W772_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W772_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W772_Task8" name="Rain check issuance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Rain check issuance: If customer chooses rain check: (a) CSR creates rain check in ERP: customer name, contact number, item SKU, promotional price, quantity, promotional period end date, rain check expiry (30 days from promo end), (b) system validates promotional price against W300 promotional rule master, (c) prints rain check document with unique tracking number
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): Department Supervisor
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W772_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W772_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W772_Task9" name="System inventory reservation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: System inventory reservation: System creates soft reservation: (a) flags item for priority replenishment per W596, (b) allocates next incoming stock to rain check queue before general availability, (c) maximum 10 rain checks per SKU per store to prevent excessive reservation
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W772_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W772_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W772_Task10" name="Customer notification on restock">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Customer notification on restock: When item is received and allocated to rain check queue: system triggers customer notification per W708 (SMS, email, app push): &quot;Your rain check item [SKU] is now available at [Store Name]. Please pick up within 7 days. Your promotional price: PHP [X].&quot;
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W772_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W772_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W772_Task11" name="Rain check redemption">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Rain check redemption: Customer presents rain check at pickup: (a) CSR verifies rain check validity (not expired, correct item), (b) processes sale at rain check promotional price per POS override per W529, (c) system closes rain check and releases inventory reservation
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W772_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W772_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W772_Task12" name="Rain check expiry and close">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Rain check expiry and close: For unredeemed rain checks: (a) 7 days after restock notification — final reminder, (b) 14 days after notification — rain check expired, (c) system closes rain check, releases inventory reservation, (d) customer notified of expiration
Responsible (R): System / CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated + 2 min/expired</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W772_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W772_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W772_Task13" name="Monthly rain check analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Monthly rain check analytics: Store Manager reviews: (a) rain check issuance rate by promotion, (b) redemption rate (target &gt; 70%), (c) average time from issuance to redemption, (d) OOS rate on promoted items feeding W596 replenishment exception analysis
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W772_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W772_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W772_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W772_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W772_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-268 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Amenities &amp; Assistance (PA-09.3).) | - operational: Customer Service Rep review and approval gate
Owner: Customer Service Rep</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W772_Assoc16" sourceRef="W772_Annotation15" targetRef="W772_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
