        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W1239_Assoc13_di" bpmnElement="W1239_Assoc13"><di:waypoint x="340" y="460" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W1179" name="W1179. Store-Level Gift Card Sales, Redemption &amp; Balance Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer purchases or redeems a BuildRight gift card at POS or online
Frequency: ~12,000–18,000 gift card transactions/month chain-wide (~8,000–12,000 sales + ~4,000–6,000 redemptions); peaks during Christmas, Mother&#x27;s Day, Father&#x27;s Day
Volume: ~40–60 gift card sales/store/month; ~20–30 redemptions/store/month
Owner: CSR / Cashier
Participants: CSR, Cashier, Customer, Finance (gift card liability management), Ecommerce (online sales)
Source: workflow W1179 — Store-Level Gift Card Sales, Redemption &amp; Balance Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1179_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1179_Lane1" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1179_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1179_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1179_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1179_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1179_Lane2" name="CSR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1179_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1179_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1179_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1179_Lane4" name="Sales Rep">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1179_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1179_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1179_Start6" name="Customer purchases or redeems a BuildRight gift card at POS or online">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1179_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1179_Task7" name="Gift card issuance &amp; activation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Gift card issuance &amp; activation: (a) physical gift cards pre-printed and distributed to stores in inactive state; (b) customer selects denomination (PHP 500, 1,000, 2,000, 5,000) at POS; (c) cashier scans gift card barcode and enters load amount; (d) system activates card with unique serial number and loads balance; (e) customer pays via standard tender (cash, card, e-wallet); (f) receipt prints gift card number, loaded amount, and terms; (g) for ecommerce: customer purchases digital gift card on buildright.com.ph; system generates digital gift card code delivered via email; digital cards are also redeemable in-store via barcode on mobile
Responsible (R): Cashier / System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1179_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1179_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1179_Task8" name="Redemption at POS">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Redemption at POS: (a) customer presents gift card (physical barcode or digital code) at checkout; (b) cashier scans gift card barcode; (c) system displays current balance; (d) cashier applies gift card as tender for purchase amount; (e) if purchase &gt; balance: system applies full gift card balance and prompts for additional tender; (f) if purchase &lt; balance: system deducts purchase amount, updates remaining balance, and prints remaining balance on receipt; (g) system records transaction against gift card serial number for audit trail
Responsible (R): Cashier / System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1179_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1179_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1179_Task9" name="Balance inquiry">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Balance inquiry: Customer requests balance check: (a) at POS: cashier scans card and reads balance; (b) online: customer enters gift card number on buildright.com.ph; (c) via mobile app: customer saves gift card to digital wallet per W615 and views balance; (d) system provides transaction history on request
Responsible (R): Cashier / System / Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1179_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1179_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1179_Task10" name="Lost/stolen card handling">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Lost/stolen card handling: (a) customer reports lost physical gift card with receipt or gift card number; (b) CSR verifies customer identity and original purchase transaction; (c) system cancels lost card serial number and transfers remaining balance to new card; (d) customer pays PHP 50 replacement fee; (e) for digital gift cards: no replacement needed — customer retrieves from email or app
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1179_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1179_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1179_Task11" name="Financial liability management">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Financial liability management: (a) system tracks total outstanding gift card liability (unredeemed balances) as a current liability on balance sheet; (b) Finance reviews monthly: total liability, redemption rate, aging of unredeemed cards; (c) for cards dormant beyond the period set by company policy: assess escheat applicability with Legal/Tax (no specific PH gift-card escheat regime; unclaimed-balances escheat, where applicable, runs to the Bureau of the Treasury per Act 3936, not BSP) and recognize unredeemed balances as breakage per PFRS 15; (d) breakage revenue (cards never fully redeemed): recognize proportionally based on historical redemption patterns per PFRS 15 revenue recognition
Responsible (R): System / Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: 4 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1179_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1179_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1179_Task12" name="Corporate bulk sales">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Corporate bulk sales: For corporate customers ordering gift cards in bulk (&gt; 50 cards): (a) Sales Rep per W103 processes bulk order with volume discount (5% for &gt; PHP 100,000 order); (b) Finance invoices corporate customer on credit terms per W16; (c) cards activated and delivered with corporate branding option; (d) track corporate gift card program separately for ROI analysis
Responsible (R): Sales Rep / Finance
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Per order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1179_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1179_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1179_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1179_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1179_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-268 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Amenities &amp; Assistance (PA-09.3).) | - operational: must validate against activation database in real-time
Owner: CSR / Cashier</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1179_Assoc15" sourceRef="W1179_Annotation14" targetRef="W1179_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1179_Flow16" sourceRef="W1179_Start6" targetRef="W1179_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1179_Flow17" sourceRef="W1179_Task7" targetRef="W1179_Task8" />
