    <bpmn:process id="W_W2742" name="W2742. Customer Construction Material Quantity Calculator &amp; Project Estimation Assistance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer approaches Sales Associate for help calculating material quantities for a construction or renovation project
Frequency: ~15–25 requests per store per day; ~3,000–5,000 chain-wide daily
Volume: Primarily for cement, tiles, lumber, paint, plumbing pipes, electrical wire, and sand/gravel
Owner: Sales Associate
Participants: Sales Associate, Department Supervisor (complex estimates), Customer
Source: workflow W2742 — Customer Construction Material Quantity Calculator &amp; Project Estimation Assistance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2742_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2742_Lane1" name="Customer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2742_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2742_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2742_Lane2" name="Sales Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2742_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2742_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2742_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2742_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2742_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2742_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2742_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2742_Start5" name="Customer approaches Sales Associate for help calculating material quantities for a…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2742_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2742_Task6" name="Customer describes project to Sales Associate: &quot;I want to tile my bathroom…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer describes project to Sales Associate: &quot;I want to tile my bathroom floor, it&#x27;s about 3 meters × 4 meters&quot; or &quot;I&#x27;m building a concrete fence wall, 20 meters long × 2 meters high&quot;
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2742_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2742_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2742_Task7" name="Sales Associate opens Material Quantity Calculator on store tablet or handheld…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Associate opens Material Quantity Calculator on store tablet or handheld: (a) selects project type (floor tiling, wall tiling, concrete pouring, painting, fencing, decking, plumbing run, electrical wiring); (b) enters project dimensions (length, width, height, or area); (c) system applies built-in formulas with standard wastage factors: (i) tiles: area × 1.10 (10% wastage for cuts and breakage) ÷ tiles per box = boxes needed; (ii) cement: volume × cement ratio × 1.05 wastage = bags needed; (iii) paint: area ÷ coverage per liter × coats × 1.05 = liters needed; (iv) lumber: linear meters × 1.10 = board feet needed; (v) pipes: linear meters × 1.05 = lengths needed
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 3–5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2742_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2742_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2742_Task8" name="System generates complete materials list for the project: (a) primary material…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System generates complete materials list for the project: (a) primary material (tiles, cement, lumber) with calculated quantity; (b) associated materials automatically included (tile adhesive, grout, sand, nails, screws, pipe fittings, electrical junction boxes); (c) each item shows BuildRight SKU, unit size, quantity needed, and SRP; (d) total estimated project cost displayed
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2742_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2742_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2742_Task9" name="Sales Associate reviews materials list with customer: (a) explains each item…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Sales Associate reviews materials list with customer: (a) explains each item and why it&#x27;s needed; (b) offers alternatives at different price points (e.g., standard ceramic tile vs. porcelain vs. granite); (c) suggests related items not in the calculator (waterproofing membrane for bathroom, primer for paint job); (d) for complex projects (whole-house, multi-room): involves Department Supervisor for validation
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): Department Supervisor
Duration: 5–10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2742_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2742_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2742_Task10" name="Customer decides to purchase: Sales Associate offers to (a) create a project…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Customer decides to purchase: Sales Associate offers to (a) create a project shopping list in the system linked to customer&#x27;s loyalty account; (b) print the materials list as a shopping guide with SKU numbers for easy shelf locating; (c) for large projects (&gt; PHP 20,000): offer to arrange delivery per W5D or project billing per W165
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2742_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2742_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2742_Task11" name="If customer is not ready to purchase immediately: (a) system saves project…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: If customer is not ready to purchase immediately: (a) system saves project estimate to customer&#x27;s loyalty profile; (b) customer receives email/SMS with saved materials list, store location, and estimated total cost; (c) customer can retrieve saved list on mobile app for future purchase
Responsible (R): System / Sales Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2742_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2742_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2742_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2742_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2742_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-268 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Amenities &amp; Assistance (PA-09.3).) | - operational: building list into loyalty profile and offering immediate purchase incentives
Owner: Sales Associate</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W2742_Assoc14" sourceRef="W2742_Annotation13" targetRef="W2742_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
