    <bpmn:process id="W_W2743" name="W2743. Customer Project Shopping List Creation, Multi-Trip Purchase Coordination &amp; Staged Fulfillment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer planning a multi-week construction or renovation project wants to organize material purchases across multiple shopping trips; or trade contractor requests a phased material delivery schedule for a project
Frequency: ~5–10 project shopping lists per store per week; ~4,000–8,000/month chain-wide
Volume: Average project list: PHP 20,000–200,000 total value; 10–50 line items; purchased over 2–8 weeks
Owner: Sales Associate (list creation); Store Manager (large project coordination)
Participants: Sales Associate, Department Supervisor, Store Manager, Customer, Supply Planner (stock pre-positioning for large projects), DC Dispatch (staged delivery)
Source: workflow W2743 — Customer Project Shopping List Creation, Multi-Trip Purchase Coordination &amp; Staged Fulfillment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2743_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2743_Lane1" name="Customer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2743_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2743_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2743_Lane2" name="Sales Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2743_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2743_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2743_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2743_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2743_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2743_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2743_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2743_Lane4" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2743_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2743_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2743_Start6" name="Customer planning a multi-week construction or renovation project wants to organize…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2743_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2743_Task7" name="Customer describes multi-phase project to Sales Associate or Store Manager…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer describes multi-phase project to Sales Associate or Store Manager: scope (e.g., &quot;2-bathroom renovation&quot;), timeline (&quot;starting next week, 3-week project&quot;), and budget range
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2743_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2743_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2743_Task8" name="Sales Associate uses W2742 Material Quantity Calculator to generate complete…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Associate uses W2742 Material Quantity Calculator to generate complete materials list for the project; or customer brings architect&#x27;s/contractor&#x27;s bill of materials (BOM) for Sales Associate to map to BuildRight SKUs
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): Department Supervisor
Duration: 15–30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2743_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2743_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2743_Task9" name="Sales Associate organizes materials list into project phases aligned with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Associate organizes materials list into project phases aligned with construction sequence: (a) Phase 1: demolition, waterproofing, plumbing rough-in materials; (b) Phase 2: tiles, adhesive, backer board; (c) Phase 3: grout, fixtures, faucets; (d) Phase 4: paint, accessories, finishing materials; (e) each phase has target purchase date and delivery date
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2743_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2743_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2743_Task10" name="System checks stock availability for all items across all phases: (a) items…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: System checks stock availability for all items across all phases: (a) items currently in stock at this store: marked &quot;Available&quot;; (b) items not in stock at this store but available at nearby store or DC: marked &quot;Transferable&quot; with estimated availability date; (c) items not available in the supply chain: marked &quot;Special Order&quot; with estimated procurement lead time per W38; (d) for items needed in Phase 3+ (2+ weeks out): system estimates future stock probability based on replenishment cycle
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2743_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2743_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2743_Task11" name="Sales Associate saves project shopping list to customer&#x27;s loyalty account: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Sales Associate saves project shopping list to customer&#x27;s loyalty account: (a) complete materials list with phase grouping, SKU numbers, quantities, and estimated cost per phase; (b) target purchase dates per phase; (c) customer can view and manage list via mobile app; (d) system sends reminder notification 2 days before each phase&#x27;s target purchase date
Responsible (R): Sales Associate / System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2743_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2743_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2743_Task12" name="For large projects (&gt; PHP 50,000): (a) Store Manager reviews project list for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: For large projects (&gt; PHP 50,000): (a) Store Manager reviews project list for completeness and competitive pricing; (b) offers project-level discount (5–10% on total project value) per W922 volume pricing; (c) for trade accounts: confirms pricing per applicable price list (trade, corporate, or project-specific per W598); (d) if customer qualifies for credit: initiates credit application per W24 or project billing setup per W165
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2743_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2743_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2743_Task13" name="Customer purchases phase materials on each shopping trip: (a) Sales Associate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Customer purchases phase materials on each shopping trip: (a) Sales Associate retrieves saved project list from customer&#x27;s loyalty account; (b) marks purchased items as &quot;Fulfilled&quot;; (c) system updates project list with remaining items and future phases; (d) purchased items can be picked up in-store or delivered per W5D
Responsible (R): Sales Associate / Cashier
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per checkout</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2743_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2743_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2743_Task14" name="If project scope changes mid-project (common in renovations): (a) customer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: If project scope changes mid-project (common in renovations): (a) customer requests list modification (add/remove items, change quantities); (b) Sales Associate updates project shopping list; (c) system recalculates project total; (d) if new items require lead time: Supply Planner coordinates availability per W38/W921
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): Department Supervisor
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2743_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2743_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2743_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2743_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2743_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-268 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Amenities &amp; Assistance (PA-09.3).) | - operational: Sales Associate (list creation); Store Manager (large project coordination) review and approval gate
Owner: Sales Associate (list creation); Store Manager (large project coordination)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W2743_Assoc17" sourceRef="W2743_Annotation16" targetRef="W2743_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W2743_Flow18" sourceRef="W2743_Start6" targetRef="W2743_Task7" />
